# Committed on purpose. Clerk publishable keys are public — this one already ships inside the
# browser bundle of every page. The secret key is NOT here; it reaches the container at boot
# via `wrangler secret put CLERK_SECRET_KEY`.
#
# It has to exist at image-build time rather than at boot: Next inlines NEXT_PUBLIC_* into the
# bundles during `next build`, so a value supplied only at runtime arrives too late.
#
# This is the production instance, which only answers on durslel.com (its Frontend API is
# clerk.durslel.com). The workers.dev hostnames cannot sign anyone in with it, and the secret key
# in BOTH Workers' production secrets must be this instance's sk_live_, or every token is rejected.
# The test and default container builds override it with the test key via image_vars in wrangler.jsonc.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_live_Y2xlcmsuZHVyc2xlbC5jb20k
